@startuml
' Figure 28.5  Verification independent of the actor (sequence)
' Reading order: top to bottom. The actor reads and acts through the
' gateway, which writes one trail line per call; the verifier, under
' its own identity, counts the actor's allowed reads on the trail,
' re-reads a sample, and re-derives each voucher. A mismatch goes to
' the owner. From loops.fare_watch.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Actor" as A <<model>>
participant "Gateway" as G <<policy>>
participant "Verifier" as V <<verified>>
participant "Owner" as O <<org>>
A -> G : Read fare
A -> G : Issue voucher
V -> G : Count reads on trail
V -> G : Own re-read, 2%
V -> V : Re-derive vouchers
V -[$FAIL]> O : Mismatch
@enduml
